---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../../components/Photo.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { areas, groups } from '../../data/areas';
import { services } from '../../data/services';
export const getStaticPaths = () => areas.map(area=>({ params:{slug:area.slug},props:{area} }));
const { area: a } = Astro.props;
const g = groups[a.group];
const isNorthBalgowlah = a.slug === 'north-balgowlah';
const isAvalonBeach = a.slug === 'avalon-beach';
const linkDrainMethods = isNorthBalgowlah || isAvalonBeach;
const relevant = services.filter(s => (g.services as readonly string[]).includes(s.slug) || (isAvalonBeach && ['cctv-drain-inspections', 'high-pressure-water-jetting'].includes(s.slug)));
const nearby = areas.filter(x=>x.group===a.group && x.slug!==a.slug);
---
<Layout title={`Blocked Drains ${a.name} | CCTV & Drain Clearing`} description={`Blocked drains in ${a.name}: learn about CCTV diagnosis, jetting and repair options, then call ${site.phone} to discuss access and booking.`} crumbs={[{name:'Service areas',href:'/service-areas'},{name:a.name,href:`/service-areas/${a.slug}`}]} schema={[{'@type':'Service',name:`Blocked drains ${a.name}`,serviceType:'Drain inspection, clearing and repair',provider:{'@id':`${site.url}/#business`},areaServed:{'@type':'Place',name:`${a.name}, NSW`},url:`${site.url}/service-areas/${a.slug}`}]}>
  <section class="wrap page-hero"><div><h1>Blocked Drains<br /><span class="blue">{a.name}</span></h1><p class="lead">{isAvalonBeach ? "Blocked drain in Avalon? Tell us whether wastewater is backing up, one fixture is slow, or water collects after rain. We’ll help plan the right inspection for your Avalon Beach address." : `A slow drain, repeated blockage or urgent overflow? Get a clear assessment and practical drainage help for your ${a.name} property.`}</p><div class="actions"><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Call {site.phone}</a><a class="text-link" href="#local-advice">{isAvalonBeach ? "What to tell us" : "Local booking advice"}</a></div><p class="fine">Mobile Northern Beaches service · NSW licence {site.licence}</p></div><figure><Photo name={g.image} alt={isAvalonBeach ? "Plumber holding a root mass removed from a drain" : "Drainage work showing equipment or pipework used for inspection and repair"} eager /><figcaption class="proof-caption">{isAvalonBeach ? "Root removal by the wider plumbing team; the job location is unconfirmed." : "Drainage technicians and equipment at work."}</figcaption></figure></section>
  {isAvalonBeach && <section class="wrap avalon-guide" id="local-advice" aria-labelledby="avalon-guide-title">
    <div class="avalon-guide__heading">
      <h2 id="avalon-guide-title">Tell us what the drain is doing</h2>
      <p>In Avalon, a slow sink, a wastewater backup and water pooling after rain need different checks. Start with what you can see. We’ll discuss the suitable next step for your address.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="avalon-guide__details">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Wastewater backing up</strong><span>Stop using affected fixtures. Tell us where water is escaping and whether another fixture makes it rise.</span></li>
        <li><strong>The blockage keeps coming back</strong><span>Say when it was last cleared and whether you have photos, camera footage or repair notes.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Water appears after rain</strong><span>Tell us where it collects and whether indoor fixtures are affected too. Rainwater and wastewater follow different drains.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p>Have the Avalon Beach address, the route to the drain and any strata or business contact ready. We’ll confirm availability, access and the initial scope when you call.</p>
      <a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Discuss the drain · {site.phone}</a>
    </div>
  </section>}
  <div class="wrap content-layout"><article class="reading">
{isNorthBalgowlah && <section class="booking-panel" aria-labelledby="booking-title"><h2 id="booking-title">Arrange Drain Help in North Balgowlah</h2><p>Tell us your address and which fixtures are affected. Mention an active overflow first so the team can discuss the available response.</p><ul><li><strong>Overflowing now:</strong> describe where wastewater is escaping and stop using affected fixtures.</li><li><strong>Blocking again:</strong> tell us when it was last cleared and whether you have camera footage.</li><li><strong>Only after rain:</strong> describe where water collects and any known stormwater access.</li></ul><p>Mention gates, stairs, parking and the person who can approve work. Confirm initial charges, the proposed visit and any reporting requirements when booking.</p><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Call {site.phone}</a><p class="fine">Attendance and timing are confirmed when you call.</p></section>}
<section id={isAvalonBeach ? undefined : "local-advice"}><h2>{isAvalonBeach ? "When a drain keeps blocking in Avalon" : `Drainage Help for ${a.name} Properties`}</h2><p>{a.context}</p><p>{a.booking}</p></section><section><h2>{isAvalonBeach ? "Getting to the drain" : g.focus}</h2><p>{g.text}</p></section><section><h2>From Symptoms to a Suitable Fix</h2><p>We start with the affected fixtures and the timing of the problem. One slow basin may point to a local waste obstruction; multiple fixtures backing up can point to a restriction farther along the sewer. A rain-only overflow needs the stormwater route considered separately.</p><p>{linkDrainMethods ? <><a href="/services/cctv-drain-inspections">CCTV drain inspection</a> helps identify accessible roots, joints and defects.</> : "CCTV helps identify accessible roots, joints and defects."} A heavily obstructed pipe may need clearing before the camera can provide a useful view. The findings guide the next step, rather than the suburb name or the nearest visible tree.</p></section><section><h2>Professional Equipment, Chosen for the Job</h2><p>{linkDrainMethods ? <>Suitable <a href="/services/high-pressure-water-jetting">high-pressure water jetting</a> and mechanical clearing tools can remove obstructions.</> : "Suitable water-jetting nozzles and mechanical clearing tools can remove obstructions."} A camera and, where appropriate, locating equipment help investigate recurring faults. We assess pipe material, access and condition before choosing a method.</p><p>When a structural repair is needed, options can include a compatible pipe section and fittings, or a selected liner system where the existing pipe is suitable. Excavation, bedding and surface reinstatement are discussed as part of the scope. Clearing alone cannot rebuild a collapsed pipe or seal an open joint.</p></section>{!isNorthBalgowlah && !isAvalonBeach && <section><h2>A Useful First Call from {a.name}</h2><ul><li>Describe what is backing up and whether there is an active overflow.</li><li>Tell us when it began, what triggers it and whether it has happened before.</li><li>Share the access details above, plus any strata or business approval contact.</li><li>Ask about initial charges, the proposed scope and any footage or reporting you need.</li></ul><p>We explain the available response and agree the work before proceeding. An inspection may identify maintenance needs or a separately quoted repair; you will have the findings to discuss your options.</p></section>}
{isNorthBalgowlah && <section><h2>A Closer Look at the Team’s Drainage Work</h2><figure><Photo name="roots" alt="Root mass removed during the plumbing team's drainage work" sizes="(max-width:760px) 90vw, 600px" /><figcaption>Root removal from the wider plumbing service network; the job location is unconfirmed.</figcaption></figure><p>Removing an obstruction creates space in the pipe. Inspection helps assess the entry point and whether further repair is needed. The findings at your property determine the next step.</p><a href="/our-work">See more of the team’s drainage work</a></section>}
</article><aside class="aside"><h2>Help in {a.name}</h2><p>Tell us the address and what you are seeing. Urgent calls are welcome at any hour; timing and access are confirmed during booking.</p><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>{relevant.map(s=><a href={`/services/${s.slug}`}>{s.name}</a>)}<a href="/drain-advice/blocked-drain-costs">Understand the cost factors</a><a href="/our-work">See our team’s work</a></aside></div>
  <section class="section related"><div class="wrap"><h2>Also Serving: {g.name}</h2><div class="related-links">{nearby.map(n=><a href={`/service-areas/${n.slug}`}>{n.name}</a>)}</div></div></section><Cta />
</Layout>

<style>
.avalon-guide { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .78fr) minmax(0, 1.22fr); gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px); padding-block: 40px 52px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom: 48px; }
.avalon-guide h2 { font-size: clamp(40px, 4vw, 60px); max-width: 12ch; }
.avalon-guide__heading p { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 38ch; }
.avalon-guide__details ul { padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.avalon-guide__details li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(150px, .7fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 20px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.avalon-guide__details li + li { margin: 0; }
.avalon-guide__details li strong { line-height: 1.3; }
.avalon-guide__details li span { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
.avalon-guide__details > p { margin-top: 22px; }
.avalon-guide__details .button { margin-top: 20px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .avalon-guide { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; padding-block: 28px 38px; margin-bottom: 34px; }
  .avalon-guide__heading p { margin-top: 12px; }
  .avalon-guide__details li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 5px; padding: 14px 0; }
  .avalon-guide__details .button { width: 100%; }
}
.booking-panel { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #2478ac; border-radius: .5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; } .booking-panel h2 { margin-top: 0; }</style>
